{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是休业式。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学前的班会结束后教室里还是很热闹。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果没有社团或者特地邀约的话，到明年之前都见不到面了。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "各务台的男生，结女的女生。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在的气氛已经跟一般男女混校的学校没有两样。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一开始还在想不知道会怎么样，但不知不觉中时间就过去了呢～”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ht1759", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊，跟大家要明年才见了。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一想到这里就有点寂寞。明明放寒假很让人开心的。”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ht1760", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有加入社团的人或许感受更深吧。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室的气氛跟一开始完全不同。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一点也不沉闷，让人想一直待着。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以大家才会迟迟不回去吧。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为了还留在学校里的各位，安洁泡了特别准备的红茶喔！”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "_ag3974", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来吧来吧，请尽量喝喔～♪”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "_ag3975", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好像错过了回家的时机。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6590", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我也来一杯吧。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4404", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哈哈，其实里面加了奇怪的药吧～”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ht1761", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵。”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "_ag3976", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂，这句要好好否定吧！不需要那种可疑的微笑啦。”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ht1762", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁开始为大家倒茶，班上的气氛更热闹了。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我也喝一杯吧。”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐，瓜生君，现在有空吗？”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_jz0006", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在我正要去端红茶时，一个女生跟我搭话。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“之前就想问你了，瓜生君有交往的人吗？”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_jz0007", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "随着这个问题问出口，班上一下子安静了下来。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“突然就来个直球呢。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ht1763", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家都很在意吧？瓜生君在跟谁交往。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_jz0008", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，很在意～”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "结女学生F", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "_jx0000", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“搞不好是跟这个班上的某人交往喔～”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": "_dc0000", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "莫名成为了全班的焦点，我抓了抓头环视周围的同学们。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是现在跟纱凪对上视线，可能就瞒不住了。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4405", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我还是看到了，纱凪的表情。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她很不安。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪还想继续隐瞒我们的关系吧。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这就任凭大家想像了。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸～那太狡猾了！”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "结女学生F", "alt_speaker_idx": 383, "voice": "_jx0001", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的有交往的人吧～？”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "_jz0009", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真正的好男人是不会把那种事挂在嘴边到处说的，呐，新吾？”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ht1764", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太立刻跳出来帮了我一把。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "多亏了他，大家不再追问了。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔……”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "_ag3977", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "另一边，安洁却一脸复杂的表情。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或许她已经注意倒我跟纱凪的事了。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁，不快点倒给大家红茶要冷掉了喔。”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6591", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊！？说的没错！来吧各位，请不用客气～♪”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "_ag3978", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "社员那边已经快瞒不住了吧。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪是怎么想的呢……", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……安洁好像已经知道我们的事了。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4406", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸，是吗？”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都回去后，我们终于能好好聊天。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我没想到安洁已经注意到我们的关系。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那她为什么没有说出来呢？”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也不知道……”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4407", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也就是说，社员中不知道的人只剩美羽学姐了吗？”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4408", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只瞒着学姐一个人感觉很不好。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你还不想跟美羽学姐说？”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯，可以再保密一阵子吗？”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4409", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然可以了，一切都看纱凪的意愿。”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4410", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得还不对。”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4411", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不对？”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。我还没办法抬头挺胸地说我是新吾的女朋友。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4412", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，嗯，再等一阵子……”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "_sn4413", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这不是旁人说些什么就能解决的问题。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只能像一直以来这样坦率地喜欢着她。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "剩下的就看纱凪怎么想了。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君跟小纱凪还没来吗？”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3315", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对，我想应该快到了……我去叫他们吧？”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6592", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，这样正好。大家，圣诞节有计划了吗？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3316", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没有计划。”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": "_sk5380", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁虽然非常抢手，不是不是，绝对不是一个人寂寞地过圣诞节喔！”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "_ag3979", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就老实点直说没有计划吧。”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6593", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也没事……不知道瓜生君跟纱凪怎么样。”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6594", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥好像很忙。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": "_sk5381", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱同学要跟新吾同学姆呼呼嘛～”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "_ag3980", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂、喂安洁！？”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6595", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，说的也是。所以我就想可以的话圣诞节让他们两人放假。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3317", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6596", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也会排出时间的，两人一组应该可以忙得过来吧？”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3318", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请、请等一下。天羽学姐，瓜生君他们的事……你发现了吗？”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6597", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，他们两人在交往吧？”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3319", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁也是从美羽学姐这里听说，吓到要前滚翻了呢～”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "_ag3981", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁是从天羽学姐这里知道他们两人的事？”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6598", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。还请安洁对其他人保密～”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "_ag3982", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样啊。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6599", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，为什么学姐你要对纱凪他们隐瞒你已经知道的事实？”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "_ar6600", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3320", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为……”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3321", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想等小纱凪主动跟我说。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3322", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱凪她一定……”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3323", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也想亲口告诉我的。”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_mu3324", "char_id": "みう"}]}
